					<div class="c-card__desc u-hidden u-block@md">
				<p>Cloud Atlas attacks the public sector and diplomatic structures of Russia and Belarus, using ReverseSocks, SSH, and Tor for persistence in infected systems and its new tool, PowerCloud.</p>
